The bundled Franka Emika Panda MJCF and mesh subset comes from MuJoCo Menagerie,
commit 62ab00f2bc44f6f20c1c9b7a13f3fb1dd41a4e35, directory franka_emika_panda.
Its upstream Apache-2.0 license, README and changelog are retained unchanged in
src/robot_reliability_testbench/models/franka_emika_panda/.

The position-only damped-Jacobian IK and actuator bias-compensation approach was
adapted from the local robot-data-pipeline project, robotics_dataset/franka.py.
That reference is not a runtime dependency and is not vendored wholesale here.
